      {
        "id": "2071974594961977727",
        "text": "Hermes Agent now reads the web up to 60x faster and 49x cheaper.\n\nScraping backends pass clean content straight to the agent without redundant processing steps; large pages are saved locally and paged on demand so you get the same quality at a fraction of the time and cost.",
