      {
        "id": "2070610321278988385",
        "text": "The strongest models are gated and access is granted only to a select few.\n\nHermes Agent now exposes MoA presets as virtual models, giving you capabilities beyond the publicly available frontier: 8% higher than Opus 4.8 and 11% higher than GPT 5.5 on our upcoming benchmark.",
